#: ../userguides/prices.rst:65 2a2ebf27fafb41f6a70ea7d9a3cdaf00
msgid "Mapflow subscription plans"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/prices.rst:67 d7948db10d24484abe2be01c4b454de5
msgid ""
"Currently Mapflow provides two pricing models: pay-as-you-go and "
"subscription plans. Currently the plans **\"Mapflow Premium\"** and "
"**\"Mapflow Starter\"** are available. It includes a monthly subscription"
" fee and a package of credits. The subscription fee is charged monthly, "
"the credits are valid for 12 months. It enables some premium options like"
" custom area size, use of any custom model that you have access to, "
"priority support, and the use of commercial satellite data providers. "
"Check the `Mapflow pricing page <https://mapflow.ai/pricing>`_ for "
"details of the subscription."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/prices.rst:71 102ae20ba41a4adfa6385085f561ac93
msgid ""
"Using the Mapflow subscription plan one can buy additional credits with "
"pay-as-you-go pricing."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/prices.rst:72 22e82c112f624183be452ec90c6377d4
msgid ""
"To activate the subscription, go to your `account profile - Balance "
"<https://app.mapflow.ai/account/balance>`_ and choose the Mapflow "
"subscription plan."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/prices.rst:73 6b7ecec13d2447b0b33a416c8f1a58ae
msgid ""
"To deactivate the subscription, go to your `account profile - Balance "
"<https://app.mapflow.ai/account/balance>`_ and turn off the Mapflow "
"subscription plan."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/prices.rst:76 117e0467856446cb89dc4514ae09f341
msgid ""
